[ai7PriestCaptured]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2>
<p>Kill me an be done with it!  I cannot continue living on like this!  Do it as a favor for me!  
<p>I cannot become your ally again...If you release me I must continue to fight you and your forces.....I do not want to continue to help in the destruction of you and your friends....If only things were different....

[ai7PriestDead]
